{"request":{"method":"GET","url":"https://api.mangaupdates.com/v1/series/27728982867","body":""},"status":200,"headers":{"Content-Type":"application/json"},"json":{"series_id":27728982867,"title":"VINLAND SAGA","url":"https://www.mangaupdates.com/series/cql4c43/vinland-saga","associated":[{"title":"Saga Winlandzka"},{"title":"Vinland Destanı"},{"title":"Vinrando Saga"},{"title":"Сага про Вінланд"},{"title":"ヴィンランド サガ"},{"title":"ヴィンランド・サガ"},{"title":"海盜戰記"}],"description":"From Kodansha:   \nAs a child, Thorfinn sat at the feet of the great Leif Ericson and thrilled to wild tales of a land far to the west. But his youthful fantasies were shattered by a mercenary raid. Raised by the Vikings who murdered his family, Thorfinn became a terrifying warrior, forever seeking to kill the band’s leader, Askeladd, and avenge his father. Sustaining Thorfinn through his ordeal are his pride in his family and his dreams of a fertile westward land, a land without war or slavery. The land Leif called Vinland.\n\n**Original Manga:** [Afternoon](https://afternoon.kodansha.co.jp/c/vinlandsaga.html), [Comic Days](https://comic-days.com/episode/13932016480029466292), [Pocket Shonen Magazine](https://pocket.shonenmagazine.com/title/00876/episode/276558)\n\n**Official English Translation:** [Coolmic](https://coolmic.me/titles/5591), [K Manga](https://kmanga.kodansha.com/title/10215/episode/323180), [Kodansha](https://kodansha.us/series/vinland-saga/), [MangaPlaza](https://mangaplaza.com/title/0303008189/), [Manta](https://manta.net/en/series/vinland-saga?seriesId=5228), [Omoi](https://www.omoi.com/series/vinland-saga)\n\n\n##### Notes: Nominated for the Manga Taisho award in 2008. Won the Grand Prize in the manga division of the Japan Media Arts awards in 2009 and the 36th Kodansha Manga Award for Best General Manga in 2012. Was translated in Chinese ([Bilibili](https://manga.bilibili.com/detail/mc25983), [Tongli](https://ebook.tongli.com.tw/book?id=c5d9a730-4498-4c12-40a8-08def2c2c072&isGroup=false&isSerials=false)), in [French](https://www.lisez.com/livres/vinland-saga-tome-1/9782351423554), in [German](https://www.carlsen.de/reihe/vinland-saga), in [Italian](https://www.starcomics.com/titoli-fumetti/vinland-saga), in Korean ([MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/comic/C000046724), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=5849261), [RIDI](https://ridibooks.com/books/505069310)), in [Portuguse](https://panini.com.br/vinland-saga-deluxe-vol-1-avisa001r3), in [Spanish](https://www.planetadelibros.com/serie-vinland-saga/8116), etc.\n\n","image":{"url":{"original":"https://cdn.mangaupdates.com/image/i502447.jpg","thumb":"https://cdn.mangaupdates.com/image/thumb/i502447.jpg"},"height":400,"width":281},"type":"Manga","year":"2005","bayesian_rating":8.77,"rating_votes":2118,"genres":[{"genre":"Action"},{"genre":"Adventure"},{"genre":"Drama"},{"genre":"Historical"},{"genre":"Mature"},{"genre":"Psychological"},{"genre":"Seinen"},{"genre":"Tragedy"}],"categories":[{"series_id":27728982867,"category":"11th Century","votes":23,"votes_plus":23,"votes_minus":0,"added_by":2095673730},{"series_id":27728982867,"category":"Abuse","votes":1,"votes_plus":1,"votes_minus":0,"added_by":54014590785},{"series_id":27728982867,"category":"Abuse of Power","votes":1,"votes_plus":1,"votes_minus":0,"added_by":54014590785},{"series_id":27728982867,"category":"Abusive Character/s","votes":1,"votes_plus":1,"votes_minus":0,"added_by":54014590785},{"series_id":27728982867,"category":"Adapted to Anime","votes":11,"votes_plus":11,"votes_minus":0,"added_by":2095673730},{"series_id":27728982867,"category":"Age Progression","votes":1,"votes_plus":1,"votes_minus":0,"added_by":14356439938},{"series_id":27728982867,"category":"Appearance Changes","votes":1,"votes_plus":1,"votes_minus":0,"added_by":54014590785},{"series_id":27728982867,"category":"Armed Combat","votes":90,"votes_plus":92,"votes_minus":2,"added_by":16657405474},{"series_id":27728982867,"category":"Arthur